flowchart LR
  U[Browser] --> UI[React + Vite]
  UI --> XLS[SheetJS: Sheet1 column A]
  XLS --> P[JSON: msg + bulkEmail]
  P --> API[Express POST /sendmail]
  API --> DB[(MongoDB user collection)]
  DB --> C[First document: email + pass]
  C --> N[Nodemailer Gmail transport]
  API --> L[Sequential recipient loop]
  L --> N
  N --> G[Gmail]
